#: includes/Admin/Screen/SettingsPage.php:120
msgid "A course with no price always shows as free. This is about hall rentals and open sessions, where \"free\" would be misleading."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Screen/MakeupPage.php:103
msgid "A make-up lesson replaces a class in exactly one course, but nothing in the timetable says which: the same name is used for the make-up slot of whichever course needs one, so two lessons named alike can belong to two different courses. Choose the course for each occurrence. Occurrences left unassigned are still counted and stored — they simply appear at no course."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Screen/MakeupPage.php:182
msgid "A make-up slot usually repeats: the same name, the same weekday, the same hour, the same room. Where you have already assigned one of a series, the others can be assigned like it in one press, and each row offers the same button on its own. Where two occurrences of one series were assigned to two different courses, nothing is offered — the series is not a series. The trainer is not part of the comparison, because the timetable fills it in some weeks and leaves it blank others; it is on screen for you to weigh."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Screen/MakeupPage.php:185
msgid "A suggestion is offered only where the lesson names its course and exactly one course fits. Filling them in records those, and only those: anything already assigned is left alone, and a suggestion you disagree with is changed like any other row. Nothing here is guessed on your behalf at synchronisation time."
msgstr ""

